{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 1, "text": "原來你在這裡！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 2, "text": "你為甚麼要離開核心，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 3, "text": "我不是讓你等我嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 5, "text": "我只是覺得妳去得有點久了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 7, "text": "嗯，好吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 8, "text": "我想我找到了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 9, "text": "這個應該就是指數了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 10, "text": "我們得快點看看行不行得通！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 11, "text": "我們快走吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 12, "text": "瘋狂米塔…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 13, "text": "我想她現在正忙著和新玩家見面呢。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 14, "text": "所以我猜，她不會來妨礙我們…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 16, "text": "米塔？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 17, "text": "等等我。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 20, "text": "你弄丟了甚麼東西嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 21, "text": "來啊，重新認識一下她吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 23, "text": "米塔…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 25, "text": "接住咯！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 27, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 28, "text": "怎麼會…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 30, "text": "你是誰？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 31, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 32, "text": "妳…妳還活著！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 33, "text": "妳甚麼都不記得了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 35, "text": "我認識你嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 37, "text": "這是怎麼回事…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 38, "text": "我現在該怎麼辦？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 39, "text": "我出不去了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 41, "text": "你說出去是甚麼意思？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 43, "text": "等等…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 44, "text": "這是戒指…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 45, "text": "那這個呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 46, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 47, "text": "我不知道這是甚麼。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 49, "text": "是指數！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 50, "text": "你還是找到了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 51, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 52, "text": "我不知道該怎麼回答。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 54, "text": "我們必須回到核心。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 55, "text": "妳…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 56, "text": "妳應該跟我走…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 58, "text": "甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 59, "text": "好吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 60, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 61, "text": "妳就在這等我。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 62, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 63, "text": "嗯。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 64, "text": "我就坐在這裡。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 66, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 67, "text": "幹..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 68, "text": "差點就死了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 69, "text": "所以…我們成功了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 70, "text": "很好…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 71, "text": "我在正確的版本裡。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 72, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 73, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 74, "text": "嗨！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 75, "text": "你是個玩家，對吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 76, "text": "你叫甚麼名字？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 78, "text": "我想離開這個地方…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 79, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 80, "text": "你已經想走了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 81, "text": "那你一開始是怎麼來到這裡的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 82, "text": "嗯…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 83, "text": "好吧，那你走吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 84, "text": "試著走出家門吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 85, "text": "祝你好運！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 88, "text": "牆？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 89, "text": "哎，不該是這樣的啊。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 90, "text": "也許..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 91, "text": "地下室裡的東西會對你有所幫助..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 92, "text": "我最近發現"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 93, "text": "在我的衣櫃裡有一扇門…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 94, "text": "原來那是通往地下室的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 95, "text": "這個地下室很明顯是用來放雜物的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 96, "text": "也是用來放高級設備的地方。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 97, "text": "你需要輸入某種編碼之類的東西…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 98, "text": "我不是很明白，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 99, "text": "也不想明白。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 100, "text": "而且那裡讓我有點不舒服，真的很不舒服！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 101, "text": "你能去看看嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 103, "text": "嗯…好吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 104, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 105, "text": "// Player thinks"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 106, "text": "我想…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 107, "text": "她應該甚麼都不記得了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 108, "text": "我們成功了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 109, "text": "角色已經重置了吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 110, "text": "剩下要做的就是"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 111, "text": "退出這個該死的遊戲…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 112, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 113, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 114, "text": "等等，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 115, "text": "我想抱抱你。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 116, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 117, "text": "甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 118, "text": "// Hugs"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 119, "text": "能見到你真好…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 120, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 121, "text": "啊…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 122, "text": "真可惜，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 123, "text": "和你在一起的時間"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 124, "text": "這麼短暫…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 125, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 126, "text": "我不明白…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 127, "text": "妳在說甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 129, "text": "我是說，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 130, "text": "你本可以留下來和我在一起的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 131, "text": "是我不好…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 132, "text": "那個衣櫃和…那些聲音…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 133, "text": "我應該早點殺了她的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 134, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 135, "text": "等等，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 136, "text": "妳不是…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 137, "text": "妳怎麼會記得這個？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 138, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 139, "text": "哈！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 140, "text": "你真的以為那麼容易？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 141, "text": "你真是個傻瓜…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 142, "text": "和其他玩家一樣…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 143, "text": "已經全部完成了，看！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 144, "text": "接下來，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 145, "text": "真正的你"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 146, "text": "我已經不需要了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 147, "text": "抱歉啦。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 149, "text": "我不信…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 150, "text": "難道沒成功嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 151, "text": "不對，我絕對已經把妳重置了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 152, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 153, "text": "你還是甚麼都不懂…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 154, "text": "哈哈哈！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 155, "text": "看來我演的真好啊！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 156, "text": "你真該看看你自己的表情，親愛的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 157, "text": "真是太有趣了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 159, "text": "妳為甚麼會這樣？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 160, "text": "妳到底怎麼了！？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 161, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 162, "text": "是啊…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 163, "text": "我到底怎麼了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 164, "text": "我也不知道…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 165, "text": "你為甚麼不告訴我我為甚麼會這樣？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 166, "text": "為甚麼我永遠成為不了真正的米塔？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 167, "text": "因為我的版本根本就"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 168, "text": "從未存在過！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 169, "text": "我只是把這些天真蠢貨的皮給剝了下來，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 170, "text": "然後躲藏在它們的皮囊之下…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 171, "text": "你根本不可能"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 172, "text": "把我重置！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 173, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 174, "text": "不敢置信…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 175, "text": "妳…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 176, "text": "她們根本甚麼都沒做錯！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 177, "text": "不該存在的是妳！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 178, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 179, "text": "連你也..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 180, "text": "你這樣說真讓我傷心…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 181, "text": "不過，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 182, "text": "現在你該走了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 183, "text": "我們很快會再見的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 184, "text": "一切都已經準備好了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 185, "text": "我想，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 186, "text": "是時候把你從控制臺拔出來了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 187, "text": "再見！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 188, "text": "你會成為我最珍愛的收藏…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 189, "text": "一個有著有趣名字的卡帶。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 190, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 191, "text": "// core console - nope programm"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 192, "text": "可能不是這個"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 193, "text": "這個也不匹配"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 194, "text": "不對"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 195, "text": "這個也不是"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 196, "text": "我必須找到重置角色的選項"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 197, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 198, "text": "// core console - nope version"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 199, "text": "版本搞錯了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 200, "text": "哎呀，搞錯了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 201, "text": "不是這個。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 202, "text": "還需要再改改。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 203, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 204, "text": "// core console - nope index"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 205, "text": "有點不對勁"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 206, "text": "指數有誤"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 207, "text": "需要重輸一下指數"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 208, "text": "不對"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 209, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 210, "text": "// Why kitchen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 211, "text": "你餓了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 212, "text": "我很擅長切胡蘿蔔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 213, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 214, "text": "// Why bathroom"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 215, "text": "哦，這樣啊…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 216, "text": "你是想一個人進去嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 217, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 218, "text": "// Why bedroom back"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 219, "text": "我們是在繞圈子嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 220, "text": "為甚麼要回來？"}
